# SyncClock module version, in the RISC OS VersionNum style.
#
# The Makefile turns this into version.inc, which supplies the module's help
# string. Bump both fields together when the module changes.
#
# 0.11 is DEEJ Technology's own version number, kept because this is their
# module: the translation to GNU as changed how it is built, not what it does.
# Raise it only if the behaviour changes.
#
# The date is deliberate rather than a true build stamp, as with the other
# modules here: the assembled module is committed as poduleroms/syncclock,ffa
# and only rebuilt when someone runs build.sh --podules, so a real build date
# would record when that last happened. Override with `make MODULE_DATE="..."`.

Module_MajorVersion	0.11
Module_Date		28 Jul 2026
